1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Okay, this is the worst thing I've ever done to my dad. Last Sunday I decided to surprise him with breakfast.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,000
I put the pan on the stove, and then my friend Jake texts me, so I'm on my phone for like ten minutes. Then I smell smoke.

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:36,000
I run into the kitchen and the whole pan is on fire. And right then my dad walks into the kitchen, sees the smoke, and just freezes.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000
He looks at me and goes, are you trying to burn the house down? And I said, no, I made you breakfast! He laughed so hard he cried. Anyway, we got pizza.
